bulletin. The bulletin has this game down as ½-½ which is consistent with
the end position; however, the score table at the back gives it as 0-1 which
would leave Buckmire on 4½/11 and West on 5½/11. The BCM (Oct.85) gives
their respective finishing scores as Buckmire 5½/11 and West 5! However, the
1985/86 BCF Yearbook gives them both on 5 so that's what I'm going with - JS.
Later: Guy West confirms that he drew the game. Thanks to Paul Summers for
investigating.} 1/2-1/2

